{
  "id": "poem-02b7e5b02b4289b843589240",
  "title": "临江仙",
  "author": "无名氏《张协状元》",
  "dynasty": "元",
  "verses": [
    "庭院深沉日正永。",
    "(净出接)杨花点点沾襟。",
    "(丑)许多侍婢汝知音。",
    "(末)梓州今一任，你去直夫人。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "元曲选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/元曲/yuanqu.json#record-2692",
